msgctxt "284"
msgid "Well! Back again, I see! What say you and me play a little drinking game?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Say, you look like you can hold your booze! Howzabout you and me play a "
"drinking game?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Sorry. I'm not the guy you're looking for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Oh, too bad. You looked like a worthy opponent, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "But if you change your mind, just come on by. I'm ready when you are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "All right. I accept. It's high time somebody put you in your place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"Excellent! But I think you underestimate the drinking prowess of a man of "
"Ryukyu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "So... What kind of game are we talking about, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"Well, the way I see it, it's no fun to just sit down and drink until we "
"pass out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"So I figured we could try a simple game of instincts. The loser drinks. "
"Sound good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "What \"instincts,\" exactly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "I'll point either left or right, and you turn your head."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"If you face the same direction I'm pointing, you lose. But if you face the "
"opposite direction, you win."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"The loser has to take a drink. Whoever gets falling-down drunk first pays "
"the tab. So what do you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "So the loser drinks, and the drunk pays... Sure, I can accept those terms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Then here we go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Which..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "way..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "Which..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "way..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "...now!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "...now!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Eheheheheh! I win!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Yes! Chug, chug, chug!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "A deal's a deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "Say, that goes down smooth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "Ugh. Might've... had a little too much..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid ""
"You're a mess, my boy! Guess that means drinks are on you. *hic* Now tell "
"me that wasn't a whole barrel o' fun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Oh, and here... This is for you. Take some later. It'll do you some good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Legendary Drinker of Ryukyu<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"I'm taking this stuff myself, y'know. Would never survive the hangovers "
"without it. *hic*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid "Er, excuse me, sir..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "Nrgh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid ""
"Yes, well... it appears the bill for you and that gentleman comes to 20,000 "
"yen. Sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "(Damn. I don't have enough on me.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "Everything all right? You don't have enough to cover the bill?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "Looks that way..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid ""
"Ah, well... That customer was nothing but trouble, anyway. Just pay what "
"you can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "You handed over <Color:8>all of your money<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "You got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>20,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "(Who would've thought he could drink me under the table?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid "Phew... Okay, I've had my drink. Time for the next round."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid "...now!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1196"
msgid "...now!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid "Gwah! I lost! Me, of all people!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "Your turn to drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232"
msgid "Abso-frickin-lutely! Heheheh... Barkeep! 'Nother one over here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1292"
msgid "You really can hold your liquor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1328"
msgid "Aaah! That's the good stuff! Now... we keep playing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1340"
msgid "Say... I think I mighta had a... tad too much... t' driiinnnk..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1400"
msgid "Zzzzz... Zzzzz... More... drinks..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1412"
msgid "Looks like he's out cold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1424"
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you so much! This customer has been nothing but trouble the whole "
"time he's been here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1436"
msgid ""
"You deserve this for finally shutting him down. I have to thank you "
"somehow... well, on behalf of all of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1448"
msgid "You got <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1460"
msgid "Here, m'boy... Take this. 'S yours now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1484"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Legendary Drinker of Ryukyu<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1508"
msgid ""
"Take that stuff... You won't feel so bad... after drinking... *snorfle* "
"*snork*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1520"
msgid "He's out again. What should we do with him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1532"
msgid ""
"Seems like a decent guy, despite everything. He can sleep it off in the "
"back office. Thanks again⑬I really appreciate it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

